{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_clt_168_1","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_168","textTraditional":"一、十有八年，春，白狄來。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_clt_168_2","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_168","textTraditional":"二、夏，晉人執衞行人石買。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_clt_168_3","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_168","textTraditional":"稱行人，怨接於上也。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_clt_168_4","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_168","textTraditional":"三、秋，齊侯伐我北鄙。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_clt_168_5","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_168","textTraditional":"四、冬，十月，公會晉侯、宋公、衞侯、鄭伯、曹伯、莒子、邾子、滕子、薛伯、杞伯、小邾子同圍齊。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_clt_168_6","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_168","textTraditional":"非圍而曰圍，齊有大焉，亦有病焉。非大而足同焉？諸侯同罪之也，亦病矣。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_clt_168_7","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_168","textTraditional":"五、曹伯負芻卒於師。","sentenceOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_clt_168_8","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_168","textTraditional":"於師，閔之也。","sentenceOrder":8},{"id":"s_work_clt_168_9","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_168","textTraditional":"六、楚公子午帥師伐鄭。","sentenceOrder":9}],"overrides":{}}